{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21091","headline":"兔丝 · 元稹","name":"兔丝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人生莫依倚，依倚事不成。\n君看兔丝蔓，依倚榛与荆。\n荆榛易蒙密，百鸟撩乱鸣。\n下有狐兔穴，奔走亦纵横。\n樵童斫将去，柔蔓与之幷。\n翳荟生可耻，束缚死无名。\n桂树月中出，珊瑚石上生。\n俊鹘度海食，应龙升天行。\n灵物本特达，不复相缠萦。\n缠萦竟何者，荆棘与飞茎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}